---
---
<section class="py-16 px-6 bg-surface-container/40 dark:bg-surface-container-low" id="features">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-on-surface mb-3">Fitur Unggulan LISA</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-outline max-w-md mx-auto">Teknologi modern untuk mewujudkan kebiasaan ramah lingkungan di lingkungan sekolah.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">psychology</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-on-surface mb-2">AI Pintar & Ramah</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Menjawab dengan gaya bahasa santai dan akrab yang disukai siswa, tidak kaku seperti robot konvensional.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">photo_camera</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-on-surface mb-2">Deteksi Foto Sampah</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Bingung ini sampah jenis apa? Cukup foto dan kirim langsung di room chat untuk dianalisis oleh AI.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">map</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-on-surface mb-2">Integrasi Google Maps</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Dapatkan navigasi satu klik langsung ke bank sampah dan titik pembuangan khusus di sekitarmu.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
